┌ Help (Esc - back) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│q / Ctrl+C        close the interface (the VPN keeps running in the background)                                       │
│Q                 quit and stop the background part (the VPN goes down)                                               │
│j k / ↑ ↓         move through the list                                                                               │
│PgUp / PgDn       page up / down                                                                                      │
│g / G             to the start / to the end                                                                           │
│Tab / Shift+Tab   switch the panel                                                                                    │
│Enter             connect / disconnect (on the current server) / fold a group                                         │
│d                 disconnect                                                                                          │
│t                 mode PROXY / TUN                                                                                    │
│p                 ping all servers                                                                                    │
│o                 sort by ping                                                                                        │
│u                 update the subscriptions                                                                            │
│a                 add a server or a subscription by link                                                              │
│x                 delete the selected item                                                                            │
│r                 rules screen                                                                                        │
│s                 settings screen                                                                                     │
│l                 full-screen log                                                                                     │
│/                 filter the server list                                                                              │
│Ctrl+P            privacy mode (hide addresses, keys and links on the screen)                                         │
│f                 change the TLS fingerprint of the selected server                                                   │
│h                 subscription: show hidden servers (restore: x on a hidden one)                                      │
│b                 server role: primary / backup (automatic failover)                                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│● Disconnected | PROXY                                                                                                │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│Ctrl+P priv.  Esc back  ? help  q/Q exit                                                                              │
